声镜 / SoundMirror

A personal style music agent: takes a person's speech characteristics
(age, gender, accent, vocabulary, personality tags) and produces music
in their personal style through 7 gated stages.

This commit (2026-10-05) ships the Agent Core v0 with verifiable
evidence — 53 assertions, real SIGKILL recovery, mutation testing,
and independent recheck. Music quality itself is NOT validated at this
point; real music backend integration is the next milestone.

See soundmirror/evidence/REPORTS/ for full disclosure.
